[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 39127.99, "timestamp": "10:52:07", "text": "，不，不，不。我不喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39130.47, "timestamp": "10:52:10", "text": "呃……我不喜欢……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39146.906, "timestamp": "10:52:26", "text": "呃……我不喜欢拼写第一件事。這是氣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39153.71, "timestamp": "10:52:33", "text": "所以问题是，气通常发音为 chi。哦，明白了。知道了。  哦，难怪大家都把那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39160.95, "timestamp": "10:52:40", "text": "女治疗师的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39168.47, "timestamp": "10:52:48", "text": "名字念成“chi”。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 39177.426, "timestamp": "10:52:57", "text": "我当时就想，等等，它的拼写是 q iqy。"}]